  #line-at(90pt, 270.24pt, "nucleate boiling regime, the heat transfer from vaporization at the liquid-solid interface becomes ")
  #line-at(90pt, 283.92pt, "increasingly important. As the substrate temperature increases, the difference in evaporation times ")
