  #line-at(90pt, 676.56pt, "thus possesses a much shorter lifetime compared to the droplet on the flat surface. Similar ")
  #line-at(90pt, 690.24pt, "conclusions can be drawn even when assuming non-uniform boundary conditions and/or different ")
