  #line-at(90pt, 354.96pt, "Fig. S6 shows the droplet dynamics on the flat and post surfaces at 180℃ and 320℃, respectively. ")
  #line-at(90pt, 368.64pt, "On the flat substrate, the droplet spreads to a certain maximum diameter (Fig. S6 (a) ")
